Tessera release archive
Version: @PROJECT_VERSION@
Commit: @_tessera_package_commit@
Platform: @_tessera_package_platform@
StaticRuntime: @_tessera_package_static_runtime@
Executables: @_tessera_package_executable_list@

Contents:
- the executables listed above
- LICENSE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt and sbom.spdx.json
- PACKAGE-INFO.txt (package metadata), RELEASE-NOTES.txt (this file) and SHA256SUMS

Verify (Linux/macOS):  sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS
Verify (Windows):      certutil -hashfile <file> SHA256
Verify (PowerShell):   Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 <file>
